    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d309">

                <pb facs="0263" n="189" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg189"/>

                <head>Sir F. Bruce to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-08-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 9, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: As I had the honor to inform you in my
                    reply of the 3d July, I transmitted a copy of your note of the 1st ultimo to her
                    Majesty’s principal secretary of state for foreign affairs.</p>
                <p>I have now received instructions to express to you the sense entertained by her
                    Majesty’s government of the friendly tone which characterizes that
                    communication.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FREDERICK W. A. BRUCE,</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
